    "description": "With the ability to alter shape and appearance, a mimic can disguise itself as almost any small household object, such as a briefcase, cleaning robot, furnishing, or appliance. It can also fit through small spaces and hide itself with great ease, making it ideal for infiltration and sabotage missions. In its basic form, with its limbs retracted, this morph is a simple head-sized cube. With its limbs at full extension, it can stand up to two meters tall and reach two meters away.",
